Your cluster "{{ .Kind.Name }}" is ready.

The OpenTelemetry Collector is receiving OTLP telemetry and printing it to its
logs via the debug exporter.

OTLP endpoints:
  gRPC  localhost:30317
  HTTP  http://localhost:30318

Send a test trace:

  curl -X POST http://localhost:30318/v1/traces \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -d '{"resourceSpans":[]}'

Watch received telemetry:

  kubectl logs -f deploy/otel-collector
